Signal ImageFrame
Signal WarningCommand [on, off]

Component AlarmSystem
    Port Camera Input EnvironmentalLight
    Port ResetButton Input ResetCommand
    Port OperatingSwitch Input OperatingCommand
    Port Siren Output WarningTone
    Port Lamp Output WarningLight

    Part Camera as camera
    Part WarningLamp as lamp
    Part Siren as siren
    Part Detector as detector

    Delegation Camera - camera:Lens
    Delegation OperatingSwitch - detector:OperatingInput
    Delegation ResetButton - detector:ResetInput
    Delegation Siren - siren:SoundOutlet
    Delegation Lamp - lamp:LightOutlet

    Connection camera:USB - detector:USB
    Connection detector:SirenControl_12V - siren:ControlInput_12V
    Connection detector:LampControl_12V - lamp:ControlInput_12V

    Function resetAlarm()
    Function setDetectionSensitivity()
    Function monitorEnvironment()

    Function startWarning()
    Function stopWarning()
    Function sirenOn()        // Sets detector:SirenControl_12V to on.
    Function warningLampOn()  // Sets detector:LampControl_12V to on.
    Function sirenOff()       // Sets detector:SirenControl_12V to off.
    Function warningLampOff() // Sets detector:LampControl_12V to off.

Function AlarmSystem.startWarning
    Parallel
        Call sirenOn
        Call warningLampOn
    Join

Function AlarmSystem.stopWarning
    Parallel
        Call sirenOff
        Call warningLampOff
    Join
